synthesize_review.prompt:
Combine the two specialist reviews below into a single verdict.

Security review:
- Risk level: {{ context.resources.review_security.risk_level }}
- Confidence: {{ context.resources.review_security.confidence }}
- Findings:
  {% for finding in context.resources.review_security.findings %}
  - {{ finding }}
  {% endfor %}

Performance review:
- Risk level: {{ context.resources.review_performance.risk_level }}
- Confidence: {{ context.resources.review_performance.confidence }}
- Findings:
  {% for finding in context.resources.review_performance.findings %}
  - {{ finding }}
  {% endfor %}

Return exactly these four fields:
- agreed_risk_level: the higher of the two risk levels (critical > high > medium > low)
- security_concerns: one or two sentences summarising the security findings
- performance_concerns: one or two sentences summarising the performance findings
- recommendation: one sentence — APPROVED, NEEDS REVISION, or BLOCKED, with reason

synthesize_review.display:
{{ agreed_risk_level }}: {{ recommendation }}

Security: {{ security_concerns }}
Performance: {{ performance_concerns }}
